---
description: >-
  A comma inside a style value (#1312, D706): rgb() and hsl() colours and a font-family list
  are kept whole. v12 dropped the pieces after each comma.
---
classDiagram
  class A
  class B
  class C
  A --> B
  B --> C
  style A fill:rgb(255, 200, 200)
  style B stroke:hsl(210, 60%, 40%),stroke-width:3px
  classDef serif color:#333,font-family:Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif
  cssClass "C" serif
